sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / SDK
    participant AuthProvider as KubernetesRequestAuthProvider
    participant SAToken as ServiceAccount Token<br/>/var/run/secrets/...
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP
    participant K8sAuth as kubernetes-auth Plugin
    participant TrackingAPI as Tracking API
    participant GatewayAPI as AI Gateway API
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>BatchV1Api
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OpenAI as api.openai.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Bedrock as AWS Bedrock<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,Bedrock: Flow 1: Request Authentication

    Client->>AuthProvider: Prepare request
    AuthProvider->>SAToken: Read bearer token<br/>(60s TTL cache)
    SAToken-->>AuthProvider: Token + Namespace
    AuthProvider->>MLflow: HTTP Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token><br/>X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE: <namespace>
    MLflow->>K8sAuth: Validate token<br/>(kubernetes-auth plugin)
    K8sAuth-->>MLflow: Auth result

    Note over Client,Bedrock: Flow 2: Experiment Tracking & Artifact Storage

    Client->>MLflow: POST /ajax-api/3.0/mlflow/runs/create
    MLflow->>TrackingAPI: Route to handler
    TrackingAPI-->>MLflow: Run created
    MLflow-->>Client: Run ID

    Client->>MLflow: POST /ajax-api/3.0/mlflow/runs/log-artifact
    MLflow->>S3: PUT object<br/>AWS IAM Auth (boto3)
    S3-->>MLflow: Upload confirmed
    MLflow-->>Client: Artifact logged

    Note over Client,Bedrock: Flow 3: AI Gateway Proxy

    Client->>MLflow: POST /v1/chat/completions
    MLflow->>GatewayAPI: Route to gateway
    GatewayAPI->>OpenAI: Forward request<br/>Authorization: Bearer $OPENAI_API_KEY
    OpenAI-->>GatewayAPI: Chat completion response
    GatewayAPI-->>MLflow: Response
    MLflow-->>Client: JSON response

    Client->>MLflow: POST /v1/embeddings
    MLflow->>GatewayAPI: Route to gateway
    GatewayAPI->>Bedrock: Forward request<br/>AWS SigV4 Auth
    Bedrock-->>GatewayAPI: Embedding response
    GatewayAPI-->>MLflow: Response
    MLflow-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,Bedrock: Flow 4: Kubernetes Job Execution

    Client->>MLflow: Submit MLflow Project
    MLflow->>K8sAPI: create_namespaced_job()<br/>BatchV1Api
    K8sAPI-->>MLflow: Job created

    loop Poll every 5 seconds
        MLflow->>K8sAPI: Get job status
        K8sAPI-->>MLflow: Job status
    end

    MLflow-->>Client: Project execution result
